     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201608/2016080814305413.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201608/2016080814305405.jpg" width=600 onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR></P>
<P align=center> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e">7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e">26</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e">--28</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日，浙江省首届“全国青少年模拟政协活动”在宁波举行。来自镇海中学、湖州二中、学军中学、绍兴一中、兰溪一中、杭州二中、浙师大附中等</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e">12</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">所省重点高中模拟政协代表队聚首镇海中学校园，展开激烈角逐。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: #3e3e3e"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">我校由模拟政协社团指导老师孙彩凤带队，经过前期模政社校内提案展示活动选出<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>名优秀社员，组成绍兴一中代表队参加本次活动，他们分别是组长邵宇辉，组员傅梦静、陈钦舟、蔡栩航、黄梦蝶、莫娇、薛政辉、裘舒宁。他们经过了三个月的提案准备，带着《关于完善高铁餐饮服务的提案》在<SPAN lang=EN-US>25</SPAN>日晚抵达了宁波，开始了他们的“模政之旅”。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">27</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">日上午，进行了开幕式活动。紧接着，开展了大会宣讲活动，<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>所高中的代表队按照抽签顺序发言，我校莫娇同学作为队伍代表进行了大会发言，赢得了在场师生的热烈掌声。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica"> <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN>27</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">日下午，活动进展到最重要的一部分即提案展示活动，提案展示分为三部分：<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>分钟的视频展示<SPAN lang=EN-US>+12</SPAN>分钟的提案展示<SPAN lang=EN-US>+10</SPAN>分钟的质询答辩。我校代表队<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名参加展示的成员配合默契，谈吐大方，从现状分析、原因分析、解决措施三个方面介绍，条理清晰，有理有据，以默契的团队配合得到了在场评委观众的广泛认可与好评。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">27</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">日晚上，在镇海中学一报告厅进行了新闻发布会，我校邵宇辉同学作为新闻发言人，蔡栩航同学作为媒体发言人参加此次活动。两位同学以冷静不失幽默，儒雅不失犀利的风格赢得了在场观众的阵阵掌声。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">    28</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">日上午，开展了界别小组讨论活动。我校代表队由莫娇作为共青团界别代表，黄梦蝶作为科协界代表，邵宇辉作为经济界代表，傅梦静作为教育界代表，陈钦舟作为社会科学界代表，蔡栩航作为工商联界代表分会场参加活动，代表队中有<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>人获得过校辩论赛最佳辩手，组员们充分发挥辩论的优势，在各自界别小组表现突出，充分展示我校学生求真、博雅的风采。<SPAN lang=EN-US>28</SPAN>日下午，我校代表队以出色的表现赢得了在四强展示中的额外展示机会。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">最终经过激烈的角逐，我校模拟政协代表队以冷静机智的表现获“杰出展示奖”和“杰出团队奖”。同时，我校代表队的《关于完善高铁餐饮服务的调查报告》以其独特的专业性、严谨性获得了最佳调研报告奖”“调研新锐奖”；《关于完善高铁餐饮服务的提案》获“杰出提案奖”。另外，我校模政代表队还获得了“最佳社团奖”，指导老师孙彩凤获得“杰出指导老师奖”。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica"> <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">除了团体的奖项，组员们还通过自身的出色表现，获得了不少个人的奖项，其中，陈钦舟获得“最佳风采奖”，邵宇辉、薛政辉、裘舒宁获得“最佳创意奖”，蔡栩航获得“杰出模拟记者奖”，黄梦蝶获得“杰出模拟政协委员奖”，傅梦静获得“最佳领导力奖”。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica"> <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">经过三个月的提案前期准备，三天里近乎不眠不休的努力，我校代表队通过出色的表现收获了不菲的奖项和荣誉，为我校模拟政协活动的的发展奠定了良好的基础。此次活动还让我校模拟政协的同学结交到来自其他重点高中的同学，通过相互交流与学习，他们之间增进了彼此了解，也建立起了深厚的友谊。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">一．团体奖<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">最佳调研报告</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">杰出提案奖<SPAN lang=EN-US> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">杰出展示奖<SPAN lang=EN-US> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">最佳社团奖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23.4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica">调研新锐奖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
